        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lithium, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lithium, at plant
The multioutput-process "Lithium chloride electrolysis" delivers the co-products lithium and chlorine. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: edfd26b0-bb79-37a7-b0e5-b3a66fa7262f
Lithium chloride electrolysis including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Lithium chloride electrolysis 
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_edfd26b0-bb79-37a7-b0e5-b3a66fa7262f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
